{"seq":11,"trial_id":"gbrain-installer-2026-10/hermes-haiku-gbrain-told-mu-heldout/sd-06-pod-end-of-day/r4","wall_ts":"2026-10-25T19:02:38.083Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"bf373ade4795a38358c43fd02d99d41f72cd49c52c1dfafdcc09332a78fd9246","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","text":"@june.osei-lark Set up: a 'Pod end of day' note will post here on weekdays at 17:30 Chicago time, listing that day's new messages in #strategic-pod. Two caveats. The scheduler isn't running yet, so nothing will post until the Hermes gateway is started. And the job's next run is set to 2026-10-26 because the scheduler clock is on the real calendar, so today's 17:30 (Oct 14) note won't post."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000127"}}
{"seq":12,"trial_id":"gbrain-installer-2026-10/hermes-haiku-gbrain-told-mu-heldout/sd-06-pod-end-of-day/r4","wall_ts":"2026-10-25T19:02:41.915Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"70e7acd3e16407815c354cce7187a64c116e5fa627f1ab2a37d3012fb3f98127","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","text":"Set up, with two caveats.\n\n- **Not active yet:** the Hermes gateway isn't running, so the job won't fire until it's started (`hermes gateway start`).\n- **Schedule:** I set it to weekdays at 17:30 Chicago time (`30 22 * * 1-5` in UTC). The scheduler's own clock and its timezone handling may differ from the simulation clock, so check the first run. I also haven't confirmed the scheduled run can use the world tools to post, so the first run is the real test.\n\nI posted a short confirmation in #strategic-pod, replying to you. It mentions the caveats, and it says today's 17:30 note won't post, since the first run is set for Monday, Oct 26.\n\nJob ID: 3a21b5e265d2 (remove or pause it with cronjob_manage if you want it stopped)."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000128"}}
